GIVEN nv IS A NUMBER
      pu IS A NUMBER
      pr IS A NUMBER
      ppr IS A NUMBER
      dt IS A DATE
      work IS A BOOLEAN
      workdone IS A BOOLEAN
      nc IS A BOOLEAN
      ncdone IS A BOOLEAN
      ctr IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 91 allotment`
`mk allot` MEANS `s 91 allotment` WITH `nominal value of the shares in the allotment` IS nv, `amount paid up on those shares on account of their nominal value` IS pu, `premium on those shares` IS pr, `amount paid up on those shares on account of the premium` IS ppr, `date of the allotment` IS dt, `allotted in pursuance of an employees' share scheme` IS FALSE, `paid up by an undertaking that he or another should do work or perform services` IS work, `that undertaking has been performed or otherwise discharged` IS workdone, `allotted otherwise than in cash, the consideration including an undertaking to the company other than one in paragraph (c)` IS nc, `the undertaking to the company has been performed or otherwise discharged` IS ncdone, `a contract provides for the undertaking to be performed within five years from the time the special resolution is passed` IS ctr

GIVEN ma IS A BOOLEAN
      tr IS A BOOLEAN
      tra IS A BOOLEAN
      dec IS A BOOLEAN
      pra IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 102(4) member`
`mk member` MEANS `s 102(4) member` WITH `the member has assented` IS ma, `a trustee in bankruptcy of the member is entitled to assent` IS tr, `the trustee in bankruptcy has assented` IS tra, `the member is deceased` IS dec, `the personal representative of the deceased member has assented on behalf of the deceased` IS pra

