GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Period
`months` MEANS Period WITH `number of units` IS n, unit IS Months

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Period
`years` MEANS Period WITH `number of units` IS n, unit IS Years

GIVEN mp IS A MAYBE Penalty
GIVETH A MAYBE Period
`prison term of` MEANS CONSIDER mp
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `imprisonment not exceeding`

